E-Waste Management System

Project Overview

Electronic waste (e-waste) includes discarded electronic devices such as mobile phones, computers, batteries, and chargers. Improper disposal of e-waste can harm the environment.

This project focuses on creating awareness about proper e-waste collection, recycling, and safe disposal.

Objectives

- To create awareness about e-waste.
- To explain the importance of recycling electronic products.
- To encourage safe disposal of electronic waste.
- To promote environmental protection.

Proposed Solution

The project aims to provide information about e-waste, its environmental effects, collection methods, and recycling practices through a simple digital platform.

Expected Outcome

The project is expected to improve awareness of responsible e-waste management and encourage people to recycle electronic devices safely.

Technologies

- GitHub
- Markdown
- Mobile phone for project development

Conclusion

Proper e-waste management helps reduce pollution, recover useful materials, and protect the environment.
